# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.DNC.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Your boot host. Names a machine, an account's scratch path and a VNC address —
# all of them yours, none of them anyone else's business. The committed template is
# boot-host.example.ini; this is the copy you fill in.
# Also hard-rejected by the pre-commit gate (ci/checks/10-no-dnc.sh), because a fork
# that committed one would send every cloner's ISOs to the fork author's machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/boot-host.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base ISOs and build artifacts. NEVER commit these.
# `isos/` is a download cache populated by `kitchen fetch`.
# Also hard-rejected by the pre-commit gate (ci/checks/00-no-binaries.sh).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
isos/
work/
out/
build/

*.iso
*.sb
*.img
*.squashfs
vmlinuz
initrfs.img
*.efi
*.c32
*.bin
!ci/**/*.bin

